{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"91993","name":"Riad La Maison des Oliviers","description":"Located just outside the city center, a mere 10-minute drive away, this charming hotel offers a heated outdoor pool in winter and convenient access to nearby attractions. Restaurants and bars are within 1 km, shops are 2 km away, and nightlife spots are 4 km from the property. Marrakech train station is approximately 5 km away, with taxis readily available in front of the hotel and a bus stop a 10-minute walk away. For those seeking coastal relaxation, the nearest beach is approximately 171 km away. Golf courses and Menara Airport are both within a 15-minute drive of the hotel. Built in 2005, the hotel's architecture evokes the charm of a southern Kasbah, featuring large cob walls, an interior patio, and a tranquil fountain. The property comprises three riads, each housing six suites, accessible through a tower containing two royal suites. Each of the four buildings boasts a private swimming pool, private gardens, and private terraces on each floor.","address":"Km 6 Route De L'ourika","city":"MARRAKECH","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40000","lat":31.55421,"lng":-7.981873,"stars":4,"giataCode":"125309","phone":"00212524375405","email":"lamaisondesoliviers@menara.ma","website":"www.lamaison-desoliviers.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/091993/091993a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/091993/091993a_hb_a_032.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/091993/091993a_hb_a_035.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/091993/091993a_hb_a_036.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/091993/091993a_hb_a_037.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/091993/091993a_hb_a_038.jpg","cat